    "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:14:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-17T09:14:27Z",
    "body": "> Maybe? It seems like we want some kind of plan for it before we this feature though.\r\n\r\nAIUI the design described in https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/issues/967 adds a new attribute to slot elements. To me this stands to reason that these become opt-in, and therefore the design is additive - which is to say _if_ we go with the proposed solution there, I believe they can ship independently.\r\n\r\nSo I don't think landing this now would close off the design space for us; landing this will not preclude us from the design in https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/issues/967, and I suspect it doesn't close off any other potential solutions in a way which would still make sense, but I'd be happy to be corrected on this.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
